{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapter":{"bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","chapterSlug":"ch08","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionCount":47,"questions":[{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0001","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":1,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":194,"y":414,"width":1026,"height":211,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":615,"width":1160,"height":120,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司X1年底有關資料如下:10%累積特別股,每股面額$10;總面額$900,000;普通股,每股面額$10;總面額$1,000,000;稅前淨利 $600,000;所得稅率25%。若甲公司當年度流通在外股數無變動,則每股盈餘為多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"$3.6","2":"$4.5","3":"$5.1","4":"$6.3"},"explanationText":"特別股股利=$900,000×10%=$90,000 每股盈餘=[$600,000×(1-25%)-$90,000]÷($1,000,000/$10)=$3.6","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"7e3afa8fa8589fdb9ef0f7ba9f8e901850826b624dc26be39ef920cc1eaab1ab","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ee2337489c33772071fb6fb1f7e89586930c5807b12580454abbd3a765bd585f"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0002","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":2,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":189,"y":725,"width":1031,"height":222,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":937,"width":1160,"height":143,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"X0年初有220,000股,9月1日增資發行10,000股,11月1日股票分割每股分為1.5股,X1年4月1日發放股票股利10%,X1年10 月1日購回庫藏股4,000股,X0年淨利$800,000,試計算X0年損益表之每股盈餘","optionTexts":{"1":"$2.39","2":"$2.75","3":"$2.85","4":"$2.95"},"explanationText":"X0年加權平均流通在外股數，須追溯調整11月1日的1.5倍股票分割，計算為335,000股；每股盈餘＝800,000÷335,000＝2.39元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"74e907e6e6caccd7a8956cdc14f434a7d2919e62cc943696eeca546fd9f8b86b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ec97dd0b36022f9f2d25fcea3edc186784630a824daf1da7f9b7399afc373a6e"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0003","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":3,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":187,"y":1070,"width":1033,"height":256,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1316,"width":1160,"height":216,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"累積特別股5%面額$100(核准發行1,000股),帳面上特別股折價為 $3,000、積欠股利$7,000,普通股每股面額$40,核准發行10,000股, 已發行8,000股,普通股溢價為$68,000,累積盈餘為$30,000,特別股收回價格為$110,則普通股每股帳面金額為?","optionTexts":{"1":"$49.50","2":"$50.125","3":"$49.75","4":"$63.25"},"explanationText":"權益=($100×1,000－$3,000)+($40×8,000+$68,000)+$30,000 =$515,000 普通股每股帳面金額=($515,000-$110×1,000-$7,000)/8,000 =$49.75","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b90da6eb054c2a49272538615155cb086e39e437874d3875a1168d7b773e205b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7ef8656b42705471068fd3eea22a891983968bec127781d169d1f8e352e9068f"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0004","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":4,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-01.webp","x":187,"y":1522,"width":1033,"height":166,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":187,"y":175,"width":1033,"height":119,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":284,"width":1160,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"花壇公司 X1 年底權益內容為普通股股本 3,000,000 元,股本溢價 600,000元,法定盈餘公積600,000元,累積盈餘300,000元,若有普通股300,000股流通在外,則X1年底每股帳面金額為","optionTexts":{"1":"$10","2":"$12","3":"$14","4":"$15"},"explanationText":"權益＝$3,000,000＋$600,000＋$600,000＋$300,000＝$4,500,000。每股帳面金額＝$4,500,000÷300,000＝$15。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a5f068683b0d87b268a0f428b13f7af199fa9053e147773ee984a80a9444eb56","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d84605b570ca81e6403ff049e8c5a98eecdb6496895cc6b526aca502efcf923b"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0005","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":5,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":152,"y":480,"width":1068,"height":213,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":683,"width":1160,"height":69,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列敘述何者錯誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"發放普通股股票股利會降低普通股每股帳面金額","2":"股票股利發放後,企業現金會減少","3":"積欠累積優先股股利不須入帳,僅附註揭露","4":"股票分割會降低普通股每股帳面金額"},"explanationText":"股票股利發放後,企業現金不變。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"22e4b71b39982bd99072b060ecf38864e1dc1b9082b54282ea62798afde21f57","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0f4eb16511cf9518cf57b49c90a5971104d40e0f678c1a36d48d508268543448"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0006","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":6,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":150,"y":742,"width":1070,"height":214,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":946,"width":1160,"height":207,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"計算每股盈餘時之庫藏股票法,係假設認股權證持有人行使權利,且公司並將因此所得之現金如何處理?","optionTexts":{"1":"投資一年期政府公債","2":"按股票年底市價購買庫藏股票","3":"按股票平均市價購買庫藏股票","4":"清償流動負債"},"explanationText":"庫藏股票法:係指測試認股權或認股證是否具有稀釋作用之方法。此法係假定認股權或認股證持有人於期初行使權利(若認股權或認股證在期中發行,則假定於發行日行使),且公司將因此所得之現金按股票平均市價購買庫藏股票。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ed6ceba7feae19ecc5d46d889c115752caf039e177710660fd3971a4e1042096","explanationSegmentsSha256":"51fe230a5c9cb503a5461531bc87f5faa4a9ee02dfe68c3b57bf321726eda4fc"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0007","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":7,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":148,"y":1143,"width":1072,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1339,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公司將公司債轉換為普通股以及辦理盈餘轉增資,兩者對權益的影響為?","optionTexts":{"1":"兩者皆使內容、總額變動","2":"兩者內容皆變動,但總額不變","3":"前者內容、總額皆變動;後者內容變動,但總額不變","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆非"},"explanationText":"前者負債減少,故權益增加,所以內容、總額皆變動,後者盈餘減少,普通股股本增加,其內容變動,總額不變。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0a642a93ed225d0ea412e0ac92cc4f0ab3353f94e4d71469c817e092cc9e16e2","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4ea673604f7184a9d11959b7bc00eb6549a1fda317eea7c0a38824d14aa74f45"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0008","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":8,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-02.webp","x":149,"y":1444,"width":1071,"height":212,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":149,"y":185,"width":1071,"height":70,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":245,"width":1160,"height":69,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大村公司發行面額100元3%累積優先股20,000股及面額10元普通股200,000股,保留盈餘350,000元,且已經兩年未發放股利,今年底可供作為發放普通股利之金額為","optionTexts":{"1":"$110,000","2":"$120,000","3":"$170,000","4":"$70,000"},"explanationText":"$350,000－($100×20,000×0.03×3)=$170,000","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"82d4db049e1ffca171b61b03fe5cd5d5c660905d5e3efce7ff2ba5bf3039edec","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a55502b6b528ffa7ecf34504ec6280f94a53ce72801d62a55ed9ca2a7e5fdbb7"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0009","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":9,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":195,"y":304,"width":1025,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":455,"width":1160,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"股本$1,000,000,股本溢價$400,000,法定盈餘公積$100,000,未分配盈餘$500,000,若股票有15,000股,則每股帳面金額?","optionTexts":{"1":"$103.33","2":"$113.33","3":"$123.33","4":"$133.33"},"explanationText":"每股帳面金額 $1,000,000+$400,000+$100,000+$500,000 =$133.33 15,000","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b796ae0fc7f2d99441fc052c645dd3c305c14b096809fd7228502be431e1a2df","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a686699c60d4e16108ffca9d2476d71a39de2014b274ddc9460d971d14bf7aee"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0010","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":10,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":181,"y":605,"width":1039,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":712,"width":1160,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以股票之每股現金股利除以每股市價,稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"盈餘價格比","2":"股利支付率","3":"股利收益率","4":"本益比"},"explanationText":"選項(1)盈餘價格比就是報酬率。選項(2)股利支付率=每股股利÷每股盈餘。選項(4)本益比=每股市價÷每股盈餘。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"fd52b8bbc9d91a74cf039ea5583f053140a3ecc042e163940ad1cf13cacd8b98","explanationSegmentsSha256":"8e420e112c53c33cbef00066098d22a1dcd0eda8d2e8ff28ebfdf147a0d0e0b2"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0011","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":11,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":185,"y":819,"width":1035,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":926,"width":1160,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"本益比可作下列何種分析?","optionTexts":{"1":"投資報酬率分析","2":"資本結構分析","3":"短期償債能力分析","4":"資金運用效率分析"},"explanationText":"本益比=每股市價÷每股盈餘,即報酬率之倒數,本益比愈低投資報酬率愈高。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d6d9c8d60533d7063d3b8e783d53c6744808846293163c08a45878f52c9cf79b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"58f20f05e7a171164a0678ec2d3a212f23bcf438b4e602cb261c4b518491e683"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0012","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":12,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":183,"y":1033,"width":1037,"height":357,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1380,"width":1160,"height":119,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"採行定期盤存制的員林公司在201X年財務報表上列有存貨850 萬元,但第二年發現,此存貨中有100萬元被重複點數,造成期末存貨高估,不論這項錯誤為管理當局有心或無心所造成,其對員林公司 201X年財務報表的影響為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"只會使員林公司當年度的總資產高估","2":"只會使員林公司當年度的淨值高估","3":"使員林公司當年度的總資產、淨值、與每股盈餘高估","4":"只會使員林公司當年度的每股盈餘高估"},"explanationText":"存貨虛增,總資產高估;期末存貨高估,銷貨成本低估,毛利高估,盈餘高估,淨值與每股盈餘亦高估。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"fae92555c8cb2eb4d516c39faf7f924f6a867843f061bcd6e8dc1f84e43c2f97","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f7ddc63d8d5f0f3fc037368593e1c46417e24e8092be5bd462347ab3dd1dcd16"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0013","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":13,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-03.webp","x":186,"y":1489,"width":1034,"height":199,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":186,"y":189,"width":1034,"height":65,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":244,"width":1160,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列哪項作法可讓企業達到短期美化帳面盈餘的效果?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行公司債時選擇較低的票面利率","2":"設備使用期限由原先的5年延長至 10年","3":"融資租賃支出認列為營業租賃支出","4":"向業主借入1,000 萬元以支應短期資金週轉"},"explanationText":"選項(1)公司債之利息費用受市場利率影響,不只是票面利率。選項(2)增加年限可降低每年折舊費用,增加盈餘。選項(3)將營業租賃改為融資租賃才有美化帳面的效果。選項(4)不影響盈餘。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"df996ae7fa63876589eb2efb2efd497e6d189986e211b9fcca637836eb161f92","explanationSegmentsSha256":"360f5cb85ff8258f29fb1c833aea25ef3c0d87c5c346771599a1aa7659c8c52d"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0014","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":14,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":179,"y":392,"width":1041,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":537,"width":1160,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"某企業採用定期盤存制,在 X1 年的期末存貨被高估$20,000,若該公司當年度所適用的稅率為17%,請問其對該公司當年度的淨利影響為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"淨利被高估$12,450","2":"淨利被低估$12,450","3":"淨利被低估$20,000","4":"淨利被高估$16,600"},"explanationText":"期末存貨高估,則銷貨成本低估,淨利高估,其影響為: $20,000×(1-17%)=$16,600","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1ce6d7577678bbae242b376ea5c42b7d4c6e4e098b89f274026b7e57fa8273c6","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b87eaf61fed20b8d412834e8f86522684569131b7aeb8295ef1fed0ac9afb35c"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0015","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":15,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":175,"y":688,"width":1045,"height":248,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":926,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"永靖企業X2年12月31日普通股的市價為36元,該公司全年流通在外普通股共100,000股,每股面額10元,該公司當年度結帳前帳上權益總額為$2,800,000,本期淨利為$600,000,X2年中曾支付3元的普通股股利,請問永靖企業當天的本益比為多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"6","2":"3.6","3":"3","4":"2.4"},"explanationText":"每股盈餘=$600,000÷100,000=$6,本益比=$36÷$6=6","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"793a01b458e99bdfa7b1b3bb954a51bf141f35891ac6e51018c48f8ae14e9b46","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7e6b9503d97b7b7a5234c3445831d54c47973a4ceded0875f34d481c4853c2d3"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0016","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":16,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":171,"y":983,"width":1049,"height":244,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1217,"width":1160,"height":346,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"田中公司於X1年1月1日按溢價20%發行20,000股、每股面值$10的普通股。若X1年12月14日發放10%股票股利，則該項股票股利將造成12月31日結帳時：","optionTexts":{"1":"流動負債增加與保留盈餘減少","2":"權益不變與股本增加","3":"權益增加與保留盈餘減少","4":"每股面值下跌與流通在外股數增加"},"explanationText":"X1年12月14日發放10%股票股利，因低於20%（或25%），屬小額股票股利。分錄會以市價減少保留盈餘，並以面值增加分配股票股利、以差額增加資本公積－股票股利；權益內部重分類，權益總額不變，股本增加。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"528a9b7969db931433ba49a944772e38ed6276221c861c7ac78bcab1fd0547b5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"6a87ce83bc24f3a9e402affd645d4d55a1f8cf00f9a3baea4463d9dcc5903613"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0017","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":17,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-04.webp","x":169,"y":1553,"width":1051,"height":105,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":169,"y":193,"width":1051,"height":204,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":387,"width":1160,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"立力公司有35,000股普通股流通在外,發行面額為$10。另有按面額$100 發行之5%累積特別股5,000 股流通在外。立力公司過去四年及今年皆未發放股利,若本年度預宣告發放$100,000之股利,則今年底分配給特別股之股利是多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"$150,000","2":"$125,000","3":"$360,000","4":"$100,000"},"explanationText":"$100×5,000×5%×5=$125,000。因為$125,000>$100,000, ∴$100,000須優先做為特別股之股利。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c658cbe626a8a4aa373d17a968b9a511c48087df771ca720b5c027b4c9d59dc5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b3712bf1eec492a89206515023300988f6b9db9184f19a1f5f03d53bfd22f914"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0018","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":18,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":199,"y":539,"width":1021,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":641,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司X1年發放股票股利,會使得該年速動比率如何變動?","optionTexts":{"1":"增加","2":"減少","3":"不變","4":"不一定"},"explanationText":"發放股票股利並不影響資產或負債金額,故速動比率不變。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"dcfe831f8d63c2dbc29b1d0a9168c7fb3361bb43ed96224ebe5acd3a7595352c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7358371cdd6053245c5d47e309a04bd9784d05c25422413f74e2feaea07bfafd"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0019","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":19,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":200,"y":699,"width":1020,"height":269,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":958,"width":1160,"height":181,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司X3年1月1日有普通股300,000股流通在外,4月1日甲公司給予公司高級主管認股選擇權,當日成為既得,可按每股$40認購普通股120,000股,至X3年底均未行使。甲公司普通股自X3年4月初至年底平均市價為每股$50,X3年淨利為$477,000,則甲公司X3年度之稀釋每股盈餘為何？","optionTexts":{"1":"$1.59","2":"$1.50","3":"$1.47","4":"$1.22"},"explanationText":"認股權行使所增加股數＝120,000－（$40×120,000／$50）＝24,000股。稀釋每股盈餘＝$477,000／[300,000＋24,000×（9／12）]＝$1.5。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e903e54157f6579b3c0041750c28111f64a3fad60c8c02e6fe50ba4ffa3312c4","explanationSegmentsSha256":"51f72e105394b7d7bd6653f5e404b9fcaa911eb7ff4a879166ee755fc087509a"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0020","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":20,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":198,"y":1129,"width":1022,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":1322,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列有關公司股票股利之敘述,何者為真?","optionTexts":{"1":"宣告股票股利後將使負債增加","2":"宣告且發放股票股利,在帳上不需作任何分錄","3":"發放股票股利,對於股票之每股帳面金額並不受影響","4":"發放股票股利,對每股盈餘之影響,需作追溯之調整"},"explanationText":"宣告或發放股票股利並不影響負債金額,但應作會計分錄。且發放之後股數增加,每股帳面金額降低。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e1da791a724428a2b5932f517857d21376be5a650f122bd47afd5423cf195872","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a2dd8be372bf7c64bb99ba5cfea5c002afde268a36d2f6f51e2b38fa63d30c52"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0021","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":21,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-05.webp","x":203,"y":1425,"width":1017,"height":247,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":215,"width":1160,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關公司宣告並發放股票股利和股票分割之敘述,以下何種正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"兩者之資產、負債及權益總額均不變","2":"兩者之股本總額均不變","3":"兩者之保留盈餘總額均減少","4":"兩者都只需要做備忘分錄,不用作正式會計分錄"},"explanationText":"股票分割是將股票面額降低,股數等比例增加,僅需做備忘紀錄,不用做正式會計分錄。發放股票股利是將盈餘轉成增資,以股票形式分配給股東,使發行在外的股票總數增加,應做正式會計分錄。股票股利和股票分割均不改變公司的資產、負債及權益總額。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"434159a790767286fe6c0008aa92fa282fcf19e478da8392d379ecebe1498f73","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e3157a0e738e7bf593ec8c83ab1d2d1ccaf92d74c82fa95c0e4b67ad3795a99a"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0022","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":22,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":169,"y":408,"width":1051,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":557,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"新營公司X1年度之本利比及本益比分別為40及10,且其當年度每股現金股利為$2,則該公司當年度每股盈餘若干?","optionTexts":{"1":"$4","2":"$8","3":"$10","4":"$20"},"explanationText":"本利比=每股市價÷每股股利=40,所以每股市價=40×$2=$80 本益比=每股市價÷每股盈餘=10,所以每股盈餘=$80÷10=$8","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"4c40a923326edc49c38b535a6a12682060cc8af98d7b2b494d88745dd1415b08","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e62cf2e6845aa9f1eff5f7385219649f0d5ba57857dddfd0bc1be5f42c0490f0"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0023","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":23,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":164,"y":661,"width":1056,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":857,"width":1160,"height":65,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司於8月10日向乙公司購貨,金額$42,000,授信條件是2/10, n/30。甲公司在8月19日支付該筆款項,則下列何者為甲公司在 8月19日正確的分錄?","optionTexts":{"1":"借記應付帳款$41,160","2":"貸記現金 $41,160","3":"貸記應付帳款$41,160","4":"貸記現金$42,000"},"explanationText":"$42,000×98%=$41,160","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d04451d66696d45cea8bde74ccbeb58c2659f1d5dc0121b13633d299e1d10145","explanationSegmentsSha256":"675b23d8fe936e824fdf65b8f72aa39ab4e9a18c7e1ba89c76b2037d37c07ad1"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0024","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":24,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":160,"y":912,"width":1060,"height":296,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":60,"y":1198,"width":1160,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列的會計處理,何者正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"公司宣佈發放股票股利時,分錄中 「待分配股票股利」已列入負債科目","2":"處分不動產、廠房及設備的收益,應以稅後淨額轉入資本公積,不列為當年度的營業外收入","3":"投資以後年度收到被投資公司所發放的股票股利時,以股利收入入帳,列為營業外收入","4":"公司發行累積特別股,其積欠股利未列入負債,僅以附註揭露"},"explanationText":"選項(1)待分配股票股利並非負債科目,應列入權益項下。選項(2)處分不動產、廠房及設備之損益應列為當年度之營業外損益。選項(3)投資以後年度收到被投資公司所發放的股票股利時,不可以股利收入入帳,而應僅作備忘記錄。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5b04e3865a9b2c4be112f2b9f25573009c62f3c80b90717e6020520ba4dc1e47","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7ffb4e9a7a3894e8addcd9b492ee0148a668ec8c752556c5b54742505cb1c2d9"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0025","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":25,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":6,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-06.webp","x":161,"y":1393,"width":1059,"height":272,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":212,"width":1160,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"所謂的稀釋每股盈餘是指企業在計算每股盈餘時要另行考慮下列那些影響?","optionTexts":{"1":"淨利受到企業當年度的停業單位損益的影響","2":"停業單位損益可能增加或減少的流通在外普通股股數","3":"可轉換證券可能增加企業流通在外普通股股數的影響","4":"可轉換證券可能對企業所帶來的潛在利益"},"explanationText":"稀釋每股盈餘即考慮了稀釋性證券,如:可轉換證券、認股權證等流通在外普通股股數的影響。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"221c8343326fff9beb75b96b734365fd2d620d4ad4c9c94d66b53e99e071a9ad","explanationSegmentsSha256":"fd834e8e572a264225a38dbb3a33a992ac178c823c2cffb97c6759e0fa73a61b"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0026","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":26,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":183,"y":313,"width":1037,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":509,"width":1160,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大方公司20X4年度稅後淨利為$100,000,股東權益包含:8%不可轉換特別股50,000股、每股面額$10 以及普通股100,000股、每股面額 $30,兩種股票均全年流通在外。當普通股每股市價為$60時,則該公司 20X4 年度的本益比為多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"0.01","2":"0.6","3":"50","4":"100"},"explanationText":"EPS=($100,000-$10×50,000×8%)/100,000=$0.6 P/E ratio = $60/$0.6 = 100","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"baf6c9b80bef42e22ddff791aa7873013e5d128259438a2a2dfdbd1a322a66fe","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f6e8decbc6eb43dfcf615234957b4b6b8e5b86f6077d6a0049e441dbb8f586c4"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0027","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":27,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":181,"y":611,"width":1039,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":757,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大林公司去年度的銷貨毛利為2,000萬元,毛利率為20%,稅前純益率為10%,企業的所得稅率為17%,該公司去年度的淨利為","optionTexts":{"1":"622.5 萬元","2":"102 萬元","3":"124.5 萬元","4":"830 萬元"},"explanationText":"稅前純益=2,000萬元÷20%×10%=1,000萬元稅後淨利=1,000萬元×(1-17%)=830萬元","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"f6371f7cd2cf7b2c7b4d13d297fa32a5ba226136e4f834469badaa1a2cff4363","explanationSegmentsSha256":"98bf575fc4f270e3feb82603329bbd888ca44c57e2fc34481dcf57546044e160"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0028","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":28,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":187,"y":861,"width":1033,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":964,"width":1160,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公司的每股盈餘會因下列何種情事而下降?","optionTexts":{"1":"結清應付帳款","2":"認列處分房屋損失","3":"銷貨收入上升","4":"減少現金股利發放"},"explanationText":"選項(1)(4)不影響每股盈餘,選項(2)認列處分房屋損失使盈餘減少,因此使每股盈餘下降。選項(3)使每股盈餘上升。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c921d35473f11dc63f9cbf39abe44c304c1d97d752c54d168c11c81d2f766666","explanationSegmentsSha256":"757a8590e18a4f83a434d9daa2f22b9c2822a26ebec02b58eac6775ebaf4a242"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0029","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":29,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":188,"y":1065,"width":1032,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1167,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"在理論上,本益比最主要之決定因素為","optionTexts":{"1":"盈餘成長率","2":"殖利率","3":"普通股股本","4":"負債比率"},"explanationText":"本益比=每股市價÷每股盈餘,所以決定因素為企業的盈餘成長率對市價之影響。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"7af466de7bce8b2a817e285d37ef226b3961cb4ae07086d5bb2c9330b215ca99","explanationSegmentsSha256":"cc92b5bb4ed842161a44cc0f725eab33c32060e679236f15fd68582eb83bd9bf"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0030","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":30,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":189,"y":1270,"width":1031,"height":200,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":60,"y":1460,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"如果公司使用加速折舊法,則與直線折舊法相比,其折舊費用將如何變動?","optionTexts":{"1":"前期折舊費用較低,後期折舊費用較高","2":"前期折舊費用較高,後期折舊費用較低","3":"各期折舊費用相同","4":"折舊費用與市場價格相關"},"explanationText":"加速折舊法使得資產在使用初期折舊費用較高,後期逐漸降低。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9d7fcb36bdad19a7da54583ff00c24a4365eedfaa62ed39df6f6b970d9de5c53","explanationSegmentsSha256":"900428f8795209868fb61dec459f157f77f8b7aee9f9d42464d937d2e5125933"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0031","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":31,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":7,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-07.webp","x":189,"y":1565,"width":1031,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":189,"y":170,"width":1031,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":275,"width":1160,"height":118,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下哪一項交易,會影響企業在期末報表所顯示的本期每股盈餘金額?","optionTexts":{"1":"期中受贈土地","2":"期中發放股票股利","3":"期中發放現金股利","4":"期末賒購辦公設備"},"explanationText":"選項(1)受贈資產記入資本公積,不影響淨利。選項(2)發放股票股利會增加流通在外股數,降低每股盈餘。選項(3)、(4)不影響淨利。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"dfeebd6914c35e5bd95f7a725b8c8c6a348bb66f5451b0df434519d3320b7d1d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c4075d8eb6cd33a918fc191df238cd7ac6683ccdfaf6c7ebe571328a05bc3800"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0032","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":32,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":154,"y":383,"width":1066,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":581,"width":1160,"height":117,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以下哪一項年度中發生之交易,不會影響企業的基本每股盈餘?","optionTexts":{"1":"發放非累積特別股股利","2":"在市場上買迴流通在外股票、增加庫藏股票餘額","3":"以買進時成本價再度賣出庫藏股票","4":"提撥指定用途保留盈餘"},"explanationText":"選項(1)減少計算基本每股盈餘的分子。選項(2)減少流通在外股數,增加每股盈餘。選項(3)增加流通在外股數,減少每股盈餘。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3f73b4ee78656d571007222c26251b77c5d6cd043f6acd7eb49a43cf68bd375b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"81e6b93fb0039057856b76ceed91baf9b46e73a497d6b576e1d4cf8f2c96b09a"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0033","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":33,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":147,"y":688,"width":1073,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":792,"width":1160,"height":69,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"將利息收入誤列為營業收益,將使當期營業淨利","optionTexts":{"1":"不變","2":"虛減","3":"虛增","4":"視利息費用高低而決定"},"explanationText":"利息收入為營業外收入,故使營業淨利虛增。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b02a03d43f43d5aeb0b0c242bb4fb3e4da47662538a1809878a35f2419136694","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b46bb020afd3defa98bff9b04d97470bcbad37725b061f97d47c30b5d09ef012"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0034","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":34,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":146,"y":851,"width":1074,"height":116,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":957,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公司的每股盈餘會因下列何種情事而改善?","optionTexts":{"1":"營業外收入減少","2":"利息費用減少","3":"銷貨收入減少","4":"減少現金股利發放"},"explanationText":"選項(1)(3)皆使每股盈餘減少。選項(2)利息費用減少使盈餘增加。選項(4)不影響每股盈餘。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"600afe66274d150ba1b50cbe76e56badf6e82bc2eb9c41b52f2824f2951bbe19","explanationSegmentsSha256":"193741a3ac7626116b6d9b45004a506da7e4b504dee1186c5cd69cccdcc911b1"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0035","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":35,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":145,"y":1061,"width":1075,"height":210,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":1261,"width":1160,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"民雄公司去年底財務報表上列有銷貨毛利6,000 萬元,營業費用 1,000萬元,營業外收入200萬元,營業外費用2,000萬元,遞延所得稅1,000萬元,所得稅費用500萬元,則其稅後淨利為","optionTexts":{"1":"2,700 萬元","2":"1,700 萬元","3":"2,300 萬元","4":"3,200 萬元"},"explanationText":"稅後淨利 =6,000萬元－1,000萬元+200萬元－2,000萬元－500萬元 =2,700萬元","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e54811000d5c8f7b6f71dffb0bfaf9651f30592dd7d2125860f0adedfe3fae21","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3121a117ccd9575db83496e55b7a0b53de0acbb0ad1a9a94eab832f8f174c560"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0036","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":36,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":144,"y":1413,"width":1076,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":8,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-08.webp","x":60,"y":1513,"width":1160,"height":161,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"在既定之本益比及股利支付數額下,股利支付率愈高者,表示其股票之市價","optionTexts":{"1":"無影響","2":"愈高","3":"愈低","4":"不一定"},"explanationText":"股利支付率=每股股利÷每股盈餘,股利固定,支付率高表示每股盈餘較低;本益比固定,每股盈餘較低表示市價也較低。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"7519ce1bb537d072605474e48de91c0051df2d780edc026c6ef3f14bc631a596","explanationSegmentsSha256":"776a33a1cd7a7ee2a7842447877f5bf2cc2550767fb3029cfa9058d0691e040d"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0037","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":37,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":194,"y":196,"width":1026,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":297,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"普通股市價下降,其股利支付率將:(假設其他一切條件不變)","optionTexts":{"1":"不變","2":"不一定","3":"上升","4":"下降"},"explanationText":"股利支付率=每股股利÷每股盈餘,市價改變對其不影響。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"3f5596fc6863cb1aa8fab666dd41f43f2d659d428e4f2c2b6fbf47bd4e1e38c7","explanationSegmentsSha256":"78a53a5256a8aee85ce548faa642a8f6314f39f48c25d2c83998d548da389020"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0038","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":38,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":193,"y":354,"width":1027,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":458,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"發放股票股利,理論上將使本益比:(假設其他一切條件不變)","optionTexts":{"1":"降低","2":"不變","3":"提高","4":"不一定"},"explanationText":"發放股票股利,會增加股數,使每股盈餘降低,但市價也會等比率調整,所以本益比在理論上是不變的。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a0033f4d7b42f4336f06816c6928e2fd5bcd3977d0577e7eb7c3447c83d4867e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"7c957566d1e98247e589a8eec22f70c5b957ae1e0d1bdf43013bdff4c70f5c7e"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0039","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":39,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":189,"y":563,"width":1031,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":758,"width":1160,"height":118,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司對於乙公司持股比例為45%並擁有控制能力,若乙公司某一年度之淨利為正數但並未宣告任何股利,則此事實對甲公司之影響為","optionTexts":{"1":"流動比率增加","2":"存貨週轉率增加","3":"每股盈餘增加","4":"每股帳面金額下降"},"explanationText":"此事實將使甲公司之「長期投資」、「投資損益」、「保留盈餘」 增加,故將使每股盈餘增加。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"442559ae2f05678eb1366ad299fbef9d6a9e40196b6272e12723157f2995a5b4","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2e5711d36211370682e88963db405312e76d5da331f5a9f3886258a4c4506821"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0040","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":40,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":191,"y":866,"width":1029,"height":255,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":1111,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"乙公司為甲公司100%持股之子公司。甲、乙兩公司全年流通在外之普通股股數分別10,000股及3,000股。兩家公司皆未發行潛在普通股。合併每股盈餘為","optionTexts":{"1":"母公司淨利÷13,000股","2":"母公司淨利 ÷10,000股","3":"(母公司淨利+子公司淨利)÷13,000股","4":"(母公司淨利+子公司淨利)÷10,000股"},"explanationText":"當子公司無潛在普通股時,合併每股盈餘之計算方式與母公司每股盈餘之計算方式相同。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"685a4adfe6cdbf0fe273ed0004ccd6ef5603af3ecfd2459adb1f11e518cb75fd","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c5d9c2b8c364d54b1a3a9dcec0fff3b256ba798bbe0a3809d3b194f8047803c8"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0041","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":41,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":190,"y":1216,"width":1030,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":60,"y":1411,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"計算基本每股盈餘之分子時,下列項目何者是無論公司當期是否宣告發放股利,都必須自本期純益減除者?","optionTexts":{"1":"所有特別股之股利","2":"參加特別股之股利","3":"累積特別股之股利","4":"可轉換公司債之利息"},"explanationText":"發行累積特別股者,其當年度股利不論是否發放,應自本期純益(損)減除。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1f8ed76a76db7568489d391bfc52365375be5da778328d386f471cf73f5a3d69","explanationSegmentsSha256":"5c1c238ae7db62a7bf57a1a83240228bf45669162e9ae99125cb6714b79552fe"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0042","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":42,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":9,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-09.webp","x":195,"y":1516,"width":1025,"height":171,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":195,"y":201,"width":1025,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":350,"width":1160,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"甲公司X1年初流通在外普通股股數為60,000股。該公司X1年初另有按面額發行之6%可轉換公司債3,500張,每張面額$100,每張公司債可轉換為3股普通股,X1年無實際轉換發生。X1年度淨利為 $700,000,稅率為20%,則該公司X1年度之稀釋每股盈餘為","optionTexts":{"1":"$5.125","2":"$8.230","3":"$5.625","4":"$10.167"},"explanationText":"稀釋每股盈餘 =[$700,000+$100×6%×3,500(1-20%)]÷(60,000+3,500×3)=$10.167","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a4d393c02bbcba782556c716d91542d4cf1ab9708853494638d5492dcc683616","explanationSegmentsSha256":"9903b140a6ad7d2a6dfb5a0ac823448ec5a30e0c156f49720ca68b7b55652c6b"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0043","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":43,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":156,"y":455,"width":1064,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":648,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大大公司20X3年1月1日流通在外普通股有100,000股,3月1日發放股票股利20,000股,9月1日增資發行新股30,000股,20X3年稅後純益為$1,860,000,則20X3年普通股每股盈餘為","optionTexts":{"1":"$14.31","2":"$15.17","3":"$13.23","4":"$11.24"},"explanationText":"$1,860,000÷(100,000+20,000+30,000×4/12)=$14.31","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6130432a3ae8842f74936ff906622609a828edef32efaae7010da4782e5a7ef3","explanationSegmentsSha256":"bb37a41f0b0be5102c384fe0644776188f1c62749911c5d8ec7201cc6cb9c82d"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0044","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":44,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":154,"y":706,"width":1066,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":899,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"每股盈餘之計算公式為","optionTexts":{"1":"普通股股利/普通股期末流通在外股數","2":"保留盈餘/普通股期末流通在外股數","3":"普通股享有之淨利／加權平均流通在外普通股股數","4":"普通股享有之淨利／普通股期末流通在外股數"},"explanationText":"每股盈餘＝（淨利－特別股股利）÷加權平均流通在外普通股股數。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"566464293323c5da936da96a5d7567d659ba02da27c5e308577976c8e1f041fb","explanationSegmentsSha256":"064fd55e8ada225d835597e923100ed6bc64f52feedb70349ec205f9eb47d1d1"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0045","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":45,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":152,"y":956,"width":1068,"height":251,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":1197,"width":1160,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大華公司X1年底各帳戶之餘額為:現金$15,000、應收帳款$12,000、設備$85,000、應付帳款$4,000、預收收入$2,000、普通股股本$50,000 及庫藏股$2,800。另外,保留盈餘在X1年期初餘額為$44,000,本期發放現金股利$3,400。試問該公司X1 年之本期淨利為多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"$11,400","2":"$12,600","3":"$18,200","4":"$22,300"},"explanationText":"X1年底保留盈餘 =(15,000+12,000+85,000)-(4,000+2,000)-(50,000-2,800) =$58,800 本期淨利=58,800+3,400-44,000=$18,200","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"49b62622efdbac710d14e494fce02ecf9ee855711d0fffd15637f2560d931c5b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"50eb386fc66bce1c0b35b80764e64fa0694f485b9155b71edf234a9d18f63e32"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0046","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":46,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":154,"y":1390,"width":1066,"height":189,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":10,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-10.webp","x":60,"y":1569,"width":1160,"height":85,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":204,"width":1160,"height":78,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列有關普通股每股淨值的敘述,何者正確?甲.每股淨值不能低於每股之面額;乙.每股淨值不能為負值;丙.每股淨值為總資產除以流通在外股數;丁.每股淨值等於普通股權益除以流通在外股數","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲和乙","2":"僅乙和丙","3":"僅乙和丁","4":"僅丁"},"explanationText":"甲:淨值還是有低於面額的可能。乙:當資產小於負債時,淨值就是負值了。丙:每股淨值為普通股權益除以流通在外股數。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c1ef7d32757dcd3927ace6b0214feec1539c2f42fb4d6c29bd7462cc3cf3fba5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"fafa4eaf3bb5d73ffbc9c774e0e3f51ff7bd0702401f66e6b0de1a01544da776"}},{"id":"financial-analysis-ch08-pdf-0047","bankId":"financial-analysis","bankTitle":"財務分析","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":47,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"財務分析-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-11.webp","x":181,"y":272,"width":1039,"height":293,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":11,"src":"pdf-pages/financial-analysis/ch08/page-11.webp","x":60,"y":555,"width":1160,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"大南公司之資料如下,X1年度純益$6,000,000,所得稅率17%,普通股400,000股,全年流通在外,每股面額$10。另有5%累積可轉換特別股600,000股,每股面額$100,可轉換成普通股3股;可轉換公司債$6,000,000,票面利率6%,平價發行,每$1,000面額可轉換成普通股20股。試問其基本每股盈餘為何？","optionTexts":{"1":"$7.5","2":"$5","3":"$8.775","4":"$6.6"},"explanationText":"基本每股盈餘＝[$6,000,000－（$100×600,000×5%）]／400,000＝$7.5。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9de0a186f6e770ffe9a26c788d36603d465b98795c507975f104825043da0d96","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3c07bc1fdecb1b1d4f1b3aadb79952b723613e9c990706563b3725f5deb96d14"}}]}}
